# EdgeCases (.NET)

Native bindings for edge_cases

The `EdgeCases` namespace binds the `edge_cases` native library through
source-generated P/Invoke (`[LibraryImport]`), so it's trim- and
AOT-friendly.

## Build

```bash
dotnet build
```

Reference this project from yours (`dotnet add reference EdgeCases.csproj`)
or pack it (`dotnet pack -c Release`).

## Loading the native library

The bindings load `edge_cases` with the platform's normal rules
(`libedge_cases.dylib`, `libedge_cases.so`, or `edge_cases.dll` next to the app or on the
library search path). Set `EDGE_CASES_LIBRARY` to a full path to load a
specific file instead.

